For an international organization in New York, we are urgently looking for a REMOTE (Senior) Drupal Lead with +3 years of Lead experience. We are looking for freelancers/contractors, who can work 8 consecutive hours.

All positions are long-term. Candidates need to be able to work the normal office hours of New York, US.

Tasks and responsibilities:

• Serve as the Subject Matter Expert for web operations and maintenance activities and/or new web projects;

• Provide team leadership and management of new web projects;

• Provide team leadership to small teams of developers working on operations and projects;

• Lead software development lifecycle, including analysis, design, configuring, programming, documentation, and unit testing for Drupal;

• Working closely with clients, conducting business analysis to determine and document requirements;

